<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction - Yuen Long site goes for HK$370 mln.</title>
<headline>HK land auction - Yuen Long site goes for HK$370 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 4,206-square-metre site in Yuen Long in the New Territories sold for HK$370 million at a Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price exceeded expectation. Analysts had forecast it would sell for between HK$260 million and HK$320 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
